      139.15,
      278.59,
      451.19,
      318.02
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 5 of the Employees\u2019 Provident FundAct, No. 15 of 1958 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d), and the legaleffect of the amendment is to ensure adequate and timely publication and disclosure of theinformation required to be published by sub-paragraph (h) of paragraph (1) thereof.",
